{"title":"2025 WSMO Accuracy Round Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_WSMO_Accuracy_Round_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> satisfy <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79058441b6eb9b985c3f36dcf8250860da926bdd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x+y=10\\quad\\text{ and }\\quad x^2+y^2=58.\\]\" width=\"258\" height=\"19\" /> Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/2/e526fbac5ee18e20a7293e9cb9c317989b31988a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x-y|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"50\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_WSMO_Accuracy_Round_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We are given:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/2/ba2b5ac9eb6a2e6921a83efaf13a05379a77a348.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x+y = 10 \\quad \\text{and} \\quad x^2 + y^2 = 58\\]\" width=\"243\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>---\n</p>\n<ul><li><ul><li>Step 1: Find \\(xy\\)**</li></ul></li></ul>\n<p>Using the identity \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/6/4268aaeb8e4a2ccf3d7d8e94be66834b5dfc8998.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(x+y)^2 = x^2 + y^2 + 2xy,\\]\" width=\"199\" height=\"20\" />\nwe substitute the known values:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/0/650a10952edee2b3570c8426cd7a43141f523fae.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[10^2 = 58 + 2xy\\]\" width=\"117\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/c/27cce4362e08992044ef087902f13ae8084f10c8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[100 = 58 + 2xy\\]\" width=\"119\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/0/740a4a0bab03955de4999e4b44a0b862f66fb760.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2xy = 42 \\implies xy = 21\\]\" width=\"181\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>---\n</p>\n<ul><li><ul><li>Step 2: Solve for \\(x\\) and \\(y\\)**</li></ul></li></ul>\n<p>The numbers \\(x\\) and \\(y\\) satisfy the quadratic equation\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/5/b35ee65af82d52f3f957c221b3d9d03bbde013aa.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[t^2 - (x+y)t + xy = 0 \\implies t^2 - 10t + 21 = 0\\]\" width=\"358\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Factor the quadratic:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/6/a369f80e9509a2c13a265ad258e581d39336b477.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[t^2 - 10t + 21 = (t-3)(t-7) = 0\\]\" width=\"262\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Thus,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/8/6988dfecd226871c4d8daba7bea104176bae3c88.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[t = 3 \\quad \\text{or} \\quad t = 7\\]\" width=\"128\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>So the possible pairs are \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/f/eefdc3460d99689f0d7ae50d4b44b23037a03231.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(x, y) = (3,7) \\quad \\text{or} \\quad (7,3)\\]\" width=\"192\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>---\n</p>\n<ul><li><ul><li>Step 3: Compute \\(|x-y|\\)**</li></ul></li></ul>\n<p>\\[\n|x-y| = |7-3| = 4\n\\]\n</p><p>---\n</p>\n<ul><li><ul><li>Answer:**</li></ul></li></ul>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/8/968cb93fbfb3fdc12bf365feb6866fead76a4cf9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\boxed{4}\\]\" width=\"21\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=~Trashboycan\" title=\"~Trashboycan\">~Trashboycan</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018033601\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.009 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.011 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 55/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2507/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:35290:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018033601 and revision id 280609. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}